## declare an array
there are four methods to declare an anrray, they are:
```C#
string[] cars = new string[4];
string[] cars = new string[4]{"A", "B", "C", "D"};
string[] cars = new string[]{"A", "B", "C", "D"};
string[] cars = {"A", "B", "D", "C"};
```
just like array in java, array in C# also has the array.Length 

